<https://vocab.eona-x.eu/netex> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "NeTEx v2.0 XSDs (github.com/TransmodelEcosystem/NeTEx, branch v2.0): netex_nm_equipmentEnergy_version.xsd, netex_nm_chargingEquipmentProfile_version.xsd, netex_rechargingPointAssignment_version.xsd, netex_units.xsd. NeTEx site https://netex-cen.eu/ ; Transmodel http://www.transmodel-cen.eu/ . NeTEx is natively XSD and PT-scoped; this is a curated SKOS rendering of an adjacent EV-charging/alternative-fuel subset." .
<https://vocab.eona-x.eu/netex> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Hub-curated SKOS rendering of the NeTEx (CEN/TS 16614, Transmodel-based) vehicle-charging and alternative-fuel subset: VEHICLE CHARGING EQUIPMENT, REFUELLING EQUIPMENT, BATTERY EQUIPMENT, RECHARGING STATION and RECHARGING POINT ASSIGNMENT plus the RECHARGING EQUIPMENT PROFILE, with their attributes and PlugType/CurrentType/PowerCouplingType/FuelType enumerations. NeTEx proper is natively XSD and PT-scoped; this is an adjacent, browsable subset for the EMDS demo." .
<https://vocab.eona-x.eu/netex> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "NeTEx/Transmodel — EV charging & alternative-fuel subset (EONA-X hub-curated)" .
